        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "3451eb03-cca8-57c8-b47c-e62931a9c3ce",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rick Hart, Steven Seagal, Tommy Lee Jones, Gary Busey, J. F. Lawton\n- Films/TV: Under Siege, Pretty Woman, Mistress, Blankman, The Hunted, Chain Reaction, Jackson, V.I.P., Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death, Pizza Man, Marked for Death\n- Awards: Academy Awards, Best Sound\n- Roles/Concepts: sound engineer, screenwriter, director, ex-Navy SEAL, mercenaries, former DEA troubleshooter\n- Places/Objects: USS Missouri\n\nFacts:\n- Rick Hart was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Sound for the film \"Under Siege.\"\n- In \"Under Siege,\" Steven Seagal stars as an ex-Navy SEAL who must stop mercenaries led by Tommy Lee Jones and Gary Busey on the U.S. Navy battleship USS Missouri.\n- J. F. Lawton received screen credits for \"Pretty Woman,\" \"Mistress,\" \"Blankman,\" \"Under Siege,\" \"The Hunted,\" \"Chain Reaction,\" \"Jackson,\" and the TV series \"V.I.P.\"\n- Under the assumed name J.D. Athens, J. F. Lawton wrote and directed \"Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death\" and \"Pizza Man.\"\n- In \"Marked for Death,\" Steven Seagal stars as John Hatcher, a former DEA troubleshooter.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "e083e1b9-8df0-57f2-8b8e-02ad8a4e3ec1",
        "text": "Page: Rick Hart (sound engineer). Sentence: He was nominated for an Academy Award in the category Best Sound for the film \"Under Siege\".\nPage: Under Siege. Sentence: It stars Steven Seagal as an ex-Navy SEAL who must stop a group of mercenaries, led by Tommy Lee Jones and Gary Busey, on the U.S. Navy battleship USS \"Missouri\".\nPage: J. F. Lawton. Sentence: His screen credits include the box office hit \"Pretty Woman\", \"Mistress\", \"Blankman\", \"Under Siege\", \"\", \"The Hunted\", \"Chain Reaction\", \"\", \"Jackson\", and the TV series \"V.I.P.\" Under the assumed name \"J.D. Athens\", he wrote and directed \"Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death\" and \"Pizza Man\".\nPage: Marked for Death. Sentence: The film stars Steven Seagal as John Hatcher, a former DEA troubleshooter.",
